{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15158","headline":"立春日宁州行营因赋朔风吹飞雪 · 李益","name":"立春日宁州行营因赋朔风吹飞雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"边声日夜合，朔风惊复来。\n龙山不可望，千里一裴回。\n捐扇破谁执，素纨轻欲裁。\n非时妬桃李，自是舞阳台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}